2019-07-09:

- first public release
2026-09-01 (audit branch):

- dyna:json: an all-digit pointer index over 19 digits is a range error, not
  "leading zero"; Pointer.has returns false for it. Patch.apply caps ops at
  65536. The add/remove/replace parse ladder is one shared helper (every
  message byte-identical). __proto__ pollution safety pinned by test.
- dyna:csv: {strict} mode throws on garbage-after-quote and unterminated
  quotes (default stays tolerant); BOM stripped; create/addRow check every
  append and surface a throwing toString instead of writing "".
- dyna:yaml: "..." no longer hangs ParseAll appending null documents;
  Stringify emits .nan/.inf/-.inf and quotes literal-lookalike strings;
  4M-line cap on the line table; BOM stripped; signed inf/nan parse.
- dyna:config: __toml_header no longer leaks; -inf/+inf/-nan/+nan parse;
  int64 bounds enforced; CRLF normalized in multiline strings; inline-table
  and dotted-key redefinition refused; floats round-trip (5.0); BOM stripped.
- dyna:xml: ]]> cannot slip past the guard on a chunk boundary; duplicate
  attribute names refused; open-tag/DOCTYPE carry bounded.
- dyna:encoding: JSON5 hex numbers cap at 2^53 (wrapped before); 64-char
  number limit removed; RFC 8785 key sort 58x faster (byte-identical);
  JSONPath first() early-exits.
- dyna:oauth2: F1-F9 (authority parser refuses userinfo smuggle, frozen
  crypto bridge, copy-before-coerce compare, quoted-string realms, strict
  exp/skew/scope, constant-time PKCE, non-object token response refused,
  WWW-Authenticate budget).
- dyna:validate: email 63-char label cap; IBAN registry +13 (incl. RU);
  dashes stripped; E164 8-digit minimum; IsJWT {algs}; delegate exceptions
  propagate.
- dyna:uuid: v7 implements the RFC 9562 same-ms counter (strictly
  increasing within a process); NanoID/ULID size args range-checked;
  entropy fork deleted.
- dyna:random: getState/setState with all-zero guard; nextBounded rejects
  non-integers and accepts full-u64 BigInt bounds; golden pins.
- dyna:bytes: holder flags invalidated on mutation (were stale-forever);
  bpe != 1 and detached views throw; utf8ToLatin1 names its two failure
  causes; countUtf16 rejects odd lengths.
- dyna:matcher: countIn/allIn scan budget (1e9 steps); MultiMatcher 16 MiB
  pattern cap; empty-needle conventions pinned; indexOf differential.
- dyna:semver: MAX_SAFE enforced on numeric identifiers and inc results;
  errors carry the index/input; Range test table.
- dyna:decimal: dec_div exponent overflow fixed (int32 wrap); mixed-scale
  Money refused; INT64_MIN and 2^63 UB guards; precision must be an
  integer; pow budget message.
- dyna:mathx/expr: betaln sign-aware; Expression min/max propagate NaN;
  depth-counter wrap fixed (uint32 wrap undersized the eval stack -- OOB
  writes on hostile input); mxbits deduped.
- dyna:time: date() and parseRFC3339 year-range guards; temporal boundary
  pins; dead locals removed.
- dyna:simd: AVX2/AVX-512 enabled only when OSXSAVE + XCR0 state bits say
  the OS preserves YMM/ZMM (CPUID alone SIGILLs); avx2 argmax/argmin seed
  the vector only when n >= 8 (was OOB reads); silu kernel called directly.
- dyna:http: 256-per-block header count cap; proxy validates header-name
  tokens; duplicate non-framing headers refused (400).
- dyna:net: TCPProxy resolve-failure leak fixed, option failures throw; DNS
  type range check, ID-collision fails the query, TXN IDs from OS entropy;
  sqlite param-count error path fixed; pg bytea hex check explicit.
- dyna:tls: server ALPN actually negotiates (select callback was never
  installed); alpn_selected into a caller buffer; pre-handshake write sets
  the error; SNI skipped for IP literals; best-effort close_notify.
- dyna:url: WHATWG serialization sets + uppercase escape normalization;
  file: origin is "null"; tab/LF/CR stripped anywhere in the input;
  URLSearchParams.sort stable; form set aligned to WHATWG; ToString
  coercion; two-argument delete.
- dyna:schema: OOM cannot report valid:true (dropped errors counted);
  getter-free equality; anyOf/oneOf keep branch errors; 64 KiB pattern cap.
- dyna:structures: LRU/bloom hash basis fixed and seeded (was a corrupted
  unseeded FNV -- deterministic flooding); LRU entries()/iterator;
  SortedMap.entries().
- dyna:serialize: CBOR negative ints beyond int64 degrade to double (was
  UB wrap to 0); protobuf map-key errors name the key; ASN.1 SET OF is
  DER-sorted; protobuf string fields validate UTF-8.
- dyna:dataframe: masks must match nrows exactly; alloc overflow guard.
- dyna:file: O_CLOEXEC on the sync opens; watcher paths heap-composed (a
  deep tree truncated at 2048 bytes); one shared async error builder
  carrying errno/code/op.
- dyna:sys: Exec deadline saturates (no signed overflow -> instant SIGTERM);
  Exec {uid,gid}; which checks execute bits (access(X_OK) is root-wrong);
  setEnv NUL/=/empty refusals tested.
- dyna:simd: OSXSAVE/xgetbv gate before AVX2/AVX-512.
- stdlib: std.popen REMOVED (argv[0] went to /bin/sh -- command injection
  by construction; use dyna:sys Exec). std.urlGet REMOVED (blocking curl
  subprocess; use fetch). os.read/write fixed a detached-buffer UAF: the
  pointer was captured before valueOf-runnable index coercion.
- make: test_codec_zstd/test_xml_large wired into slim MODTESTS with
  cross-module companions; test_validate_ext documented as full-binary-only.
- tests: official corpora vendored (json-patch-tests, JSON-Schema-Test-Suite
  draft2020-12, WPT urltestdata, toml-test); conformance runners, parametric
  coverage grids for dataframe/mathx/ml, and a bounded adversarial sweep.
